inequality. And what I want to understand,

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:01.710
one, to understand and what the book addresses
is, is why those kinds of programs don't work

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:07.859
or why that approach actually led to shrinking
the social welfare state and compounding inequality

00:02:07.859 --> 00:02:10.520
and really contributing to many of the kind
of problems we are seeing today.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:15.640
